TCP uses sequence numbers and acknowledgements to detect loss and retransmit missing segments.


🔥 Complete Flow (When You Open a Website)
🧠 Think like this always:
1. DNS → "What is the IP?"
2. TCP → "Let’s connect"
3. HTTP/HTTPS → "Send request"
4. Server → "Here is data"
🔹 Step 1: DNS (Application Layer)
You type: google.com
DNS gives IP: 142.x.x.x
🔹 Step 2: TCP Connection (Transport Layer)

Client→Server:SYN
Server→Client:SYN+ACK
Client→Server:ACK

👉 Connection established

🔹 Step 3: HTTP/HTTPS Request
GET /index.html
🔹 Step 4: Server Responds
200 OK → Website loads


